<section id="about" class="section about-section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2 id="about-heading" class="section-title">
      Sino kami
    </h2>
    <p class="about-lede">
      campus.tools is a group of students who build small, free tools for
      campus life and learn software engineering by shipping them.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every tool is open source under MIT. Where a tool has campus data worth
      sharing, we publish it as open data so other campuses can fork it.
    </p>
    <p>
      We don't sell data. We don't track anything beyond cookieless page
      counts, and ads stay off the interactive map. Donations cover hosting and
      contributor payouts.
    </p>
    <p>
      New contributors learn on real pull requests, with code review, release
      cycles, and a good first issue queue. Walang entrance exam. Kung kaya mong
      mag-git push, kaya mong tumulong.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-card);
  }

  .about-section p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .about-lede {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-ink);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
